schema: "0.4"
id: echo-of-manifestation-marketing-trailer-storyboard
type: image
service: anthropic
quality: high

prompt:
  text: >
    Dark fantasy concept art showing 6 key frames for a game trailer storyboard for "Echo
    of Manifestation", arranged in a 3x2 grid, each frame 16:9 aspect ratio with a thin
    dark border between frames. Each frame is a cinematic composition rendered in dark
    fantasy concept art style:

    FRAME 1 (Top-Left) — "THE BOUNDARY OPENS": A vast vertical tear in reality splits
    the composition in half. On the left: a mundane city street at dusk, streetlamps
    casting orange light. On the right: the Twilight Zone — deep indigo void, impossible
    architecture, amber essence particles. The tear itself is the focal point — reality
    splitting open like fabric, edges dissolving. Small human figure (the Survivor)
    stands at the base of the tear, looking up. Cinematic scale, the tear dwarfs
    everything. Label: "01" in bottom-left corner.

    FRAME 2 (Top-Center) — "FIRST TRANSMUTATION": Close-up of the Survivor's hands at
    the Alchemy Shrine, placing an iron sword onto the stone altar. The transmutation
    circle beneath the sword begins to glow amber, essence flowing through carved channels
    like liquid mercury. The sword is beginning to transform — edges blurring, light
    intensifying. The Survivor's face is visible above, expression of concentration and
    hope — they don't know what's about to happen. Intimate, tense composition.
    Label: "02" in bottom-left corner.

    FRAME 3 (Top-Right) — "FIRST CHIMERA": The Shadow Blade erupts from the shrine's
    shadow, fully formed and lunging. The Survivor stumbles backward, eyes wide with shock
    and horror. The chimera's jagged shadow-sword is mid-swing. The Alchemy Shrine behind
    the chimera still glows amber. This is the moment of revelation — creation spawns
    destruction. Dynamic action composition with strong diagonal lines. Label: "03" in
    bottom-left corner.

    FRAME 4 (Bottom-Left) — "ECHO REVEAL": The Survivor, wounded and exhausted, slumps
    against a wall in the Twilight Zone. From the shadows, Echo steps forward — the
    9-year-old girl in her simple dress, pale and calm, surrounded by faint light, casting
    no shadow. She extends a hand toward the Survivor. The composition is centered on their
    hands — one reaching, one hesitating. Emotional beat, the color palette softens slightly
    here to amber-warmth meeting pale light. Label: "04" in bottom-left corner.

    FRAME 5 (Bottom-Center) — "THE THRESHOLD": The Survivor and Echo stand at the edge of
    Zone 8, the Threshold. The world has lost all color — pure black and white. The boundary
    between worlds is dissolving, shadows move independently, architectural fragments float
    in void. The two figures are tiny against the vast negation. The Grand Manifestation is
    visible in the far distance — a jagged crystalline form of pure black and white geometry.
    Epic scale, existential dread. Label: "05" in bottom-left corner.

    FRAME 6 (Bottom-Right) — "GRAND MANIFESTATION": The final confrontation. The Grand
    Manifestation fills the upper two-thirds of the frame — an impossibly large crystalline
    entity of jagged black and white geometry, simultaneously reflecting weapon shapes.
    Below it, the Survivor and Echo stand side by side, tiny but defiant. Amber light from
    the Survivor's lantern is the only color in the frame — a single point of warmth against
    the black and white entity. David and Goliath scale contrast. Label: "06" in
    bottom-left corner.

    Each frame should feel like a distinct cinematic moment with different composition and
    lighting appropriate to its emotional beat, while maintaining visual coherence through
    the shared art style and palette. Painterly concept art quality throughout.
  negative: "bright, cheerful, cartoon, anime, clean magic, simple storyboard sketches, stick figures, rough draft quality, colorful palette, low detail, flat shading, text-heavy, speech bubbles"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1920
    height: 1080
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"

tags: [marketing, trailer, storyboard, key-frames, cinematic, concept-art, dark-fantasy]
